wnloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/deployments","created_at":"2017-10-05T21:56:00Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T01:01:53Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-13T05:03:31Z","git_url":"git://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db","homepage":"https://www.yugabyte.com","size":908218,"stargazers_count":9958,"watchers_count":9958,"language":"C","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":1201,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":7608,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["cloud-native","cpp","database","distributed-database","distributed-sql","distributed-sql-database","high-performance","kubernetes","multi-cloud","multi-region","scale-out","sql"],"visibility":"public","forks":1201,"open_issues":7608,"watchers":9958,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Currently, we only support either having a placement policy set at the cluster level OR at the table level and in production we generally set the cluster policy and would not allow tables to set their own. This came up during #54 and has been a long standing item on our list for a while now...\r\n\r\nWe should build a way in which the defaults just cascade:\r\n- if you have a table level policy, we use that\r\n- else, if you have a namespace level policy, we use that\r\n- else, if you have a cluster level one, we use that (note: we already have an empty default here already)\r\n- else, we might just use some GFLAGS to control defaults like replication factor (RF)\r\n\r\nThe important part would be to decide how we'd like to manage these overrides and if they could be completely independent, or we'd like to somehow inherit properties.\r\n\r\nSay if you define a policy on your cluster to setup RF3 with a replica in each of 3 regions: A, B, C, then would like a namespace defined underneath to:\r\n- only allow data to be placed in a subset of A, B, C\r\n- allow data to live anywhere, as this placement info should be independent\r\n- have some other constraints (?)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/149/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/149/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/380249609","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/54#issuecomment-380249609","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/54","id":380249609,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM4MDI0OTYwOQ==","user":{"login":"bmatican","id":395011,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NTAxMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/395011?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican","html_url":"https://github.com/bmatican","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmatican/followers","following_url":"https